    {
      "id": "e001031",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 692,
      "y": 565.4089107480546,
      "width": 294.20379638671875,
      "height": 115.53776528682597,
      "text": "• Snapshot(): mu_ 内截断 logs_,由上层kvserver调用\n• SaveSnapshotBlob: snap_io_mu_ 锁外\n  fsync(两阶段落盘)\n• saved_blob_index_ 单调防覆盖\n• 锁序 snap_io_mu_→mu_ 唯一\n  (防饿死心跳/死锁 坑B/J)\n• 持久化kvmap snapshot\n• 截断已经快照过的logs，同时截断从磁盘镜像出的entries",
      "fontSize": 11.553776528682597,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Snapshot(): mu_ 内截断 logs_,由上层kvserver调用\n• SaveSnapshotBlob: snap_io_mu_ 锁外\n  fsync(两阶段落盘)\n• saved_blob_index_ 单调防覆盖\n• 锁序 snap_io_mu_→mu_ 唯一\n  (防饿死心跳/死锁 坑B/J)\n• 持久化kvmap snapshot\n• 截断已经快照过的logs，同时截断从磁盘镜像出的entries",
