      "x": 1052,
      "y": 137.6,
      "width": 275.578125,
      "height": 60,
      "text": "• 取 ri = rf_->ReadIndex()\n• 循环等 last_cmd_index_ >= ri\n• 再读本地 kv_store_\n• 失败重试 / 换 leader或者follower，两种角色均可读",
