      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• 取 ri = rf_->ReadIndex()\n• 循环等 last_cmd_index_ >= ri\n• 再读本地 kv_store_\n• 失败重试 / 换 leader或者follower，两种角色均可读",
