      "x": 1052,
      "y": 327.6,
      "width": 276,
      "height": 79,
      "text": "• WaitOp → rf_->Start(op)\n• 拿 index 后等 applyCh\n• ApplierLoop 应用 + 去重\n• (client_id,seq_id) 幂等\n• last_cmd_index_ 推进",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
