      "type": "text",
      "x": 1074.89163929992,
      "y": 1325.0729191672278,
      "width": 251.583984375,
      "height": 105,
      "text": "• SaveStateAndSnapshot(state,blob)\n• SaveSnapshotOnly(blob) 两阶段\n• RaftStateSize() 阈值门控\n• ReadSnapshot() 重启恢复\n• PersistLocked() 持久化状态\n• ReadPersist(). 恢复快照+状态\n• 日志logs 改落 raft.log.seg，这里只存临时状态",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• SaveStateAndSnapshot(state,blob)\n• SaveSnapshotOnly(blob) 两阶段\n• RaftStateSize() 阈值门控\n• ReadSnapshot() 重启恢复\n• PersistLocked() 持久化状态\n• ReadPersist(). 恢复快照+状态\n• 日志logs 改落 raft.log.seg，这里只存临时状态",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
