    {
      "id": "sT_body1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1050.4211399320998,
      "y": 841.9033363301785,
      "width": 280.716796875,
      "height": 135,
      "text": "• sessions_: client_id → (last_seq, last_index)\n  last_seq是去重int类型，每发起一次更新操作++，\n  last_index用作空闲淘汰，当该client太久没发起日志\n  时淘汰。\n• LRU 容量上限 cap + 空闲淘汰 max_idle\n• apply 比对 op.seq_id > existing 才执行（幂等）\n• 淘汰触发 Reap → 写 fenced_ 墓碑，被淘汰的会话\n  进入垃圾桶，垃圾桶可被清理。\n• 随 KV 快照持久化（ForEach 顺序）",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• sessions_: client_id → (last_seq, last_index)\n  last_seq是去重int类型，每发起一次更新操作++，\n  last_index用作空闲淘汰，当该client太久没发起日志\n  时淘汰。\n• LRU 容量上限 cap + 空闲淘汰 max_idle\n• apply 比对 op.seq_id > existing 才执行（幂等）\n• 淘汰触发 Reap → 写 fenced_ 墓碑，被淘汰的会话\n  进入垃圾桶，垃圾桶可被清理。\n• 随 KV 快照持久化（ForEach 顺序）",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 12,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
