      "y": 1047.6114349770378,
      "width": 276,
      "height": 90,
      "text": "• fenced_: cid → last_seq（被淘汰会话）\n• 迟到重试被拒 kSessionGone → Clerk 旋转 client_id\n• fence_fifo_ 顺序编解码，副本间一致",
