    {
      "id": "wm_text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 692,
      "y": 1246.5377848205017,
      "width": 241.517578125,
      "height": 75,
      "text": "① 磁盘水位保护 disk_full 信号\n• Start() 提交前判 RaftStateSize≥maxraftstate\n   → 返回 disk_full\n• ProposeConfChangeTo 同构对称守卫\n• KVServer 收 disk_full → 强制快照压缩",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "① 磁盘水位保护 disk_full 信号\n• Start() 提交前判 RaftStateSize≥maxraftstate\n   → 返回 disk_full\n• ProposeConfChangeTo 同构对称守卫\n• KVServer 收 disk_full → 强制快照压缩",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 12,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
